\"id\":1236,\"url\":\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sorfeny_1-scaled.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"tooltipText\":\"\"},{\"id\":1237,\"url\":\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sorfeny_2-scaled.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"tooltipText\":\"\"},{\"id\":1238,\"url\":\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sorfeny_3-scaled.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"tooltipText\":\"\"}],\"navigationArrowDesktopBorderRadiusCssStyle\":\"50px 50px 50px 50px\",\"navigationArrowTabletBorderRadiusCssStyle\":\"50px 50px 50px 50px\",\"navigationArrowMobileBorderRadiusCssStyle\":\"50px 50px 50px 50px\",\"paginationNormalDotsDesktopBorderRadiusCssStyle\":\"50px 50px 50px 50px\",\"paginationNormalDotsTabletBorderRadiusCssStyle\":\"50px 50px 50px 50px\",\"paginationNormalDotsMobileBorderRadiusCssStyle\":\"50px 50px 50px 50px\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-gslider-blocks-image-slider gslider-image-slider-wrapper gslider-image-slider-f25445c2 inside center has-pagination\" data-swiper-settings=\"{&quot;effect&quot;:&quot;slide&quot;,&quot;breakpoints&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:{&quot;slidesPerView&quot;:1,&quot;spaceBetween&quot;:0,&quot;speed&quot;:800,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;navigation&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:true},&quot;pagination&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:true}},&quot;768&quot;:{&quot;slidesPerView&quot;:1,&quot;spaceBetween&quot;:20,&quot;speed&quot;:800,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;navigation&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:true},&quot;pagination&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:true}},&quot;1025&quot;:{&quot;slidesPerView&quot;:1,&quot;spaceBetween&quot;:20,&quot;speed&quot;:800,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;navigation&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:true},&quot;pagination&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:true}}},&quot;loop&quot;:true,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;allowTouchMove&quot;:true,&quot;mousewheel&quot;:false,&quot;keyboard&quot;:false,&quot;navigation&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:true,&quot;nextEl&quot;:&quot;.swiper-button-next&quot;,&quot;prevEl&quot;:&quot;.swiper-button-prev&quot;},&quot;pagination&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:true,&quot;el&quot;:&quot;.gslider-image-slider-f25445c2 .swiper-pagination-image-slider&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bullets&quot;,&quot;dynamicBullets&quot;:false,&quot;clickable&quot;:true}}\"><div class=\"swiper\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Image Slider\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide\"><div class=\"gslider-image-slider-content-wrapper \"><div class=\"gslider-image-item\" data-hover-effect=\"none\"><img src=\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sorfeny_1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"image 1\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"swiper-slide\"><div class=\"gslider-image-slider-content-wrapper \"><div class=\"gslider-image-item\" data-hover-effect=\"none\"><img src=\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sorfeny_2-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"image 2\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"swiper-slide\"><div class=\"gslider-image-slider-content-wrapper \"><div class=\"gslider-image-item\" data-hover-effect=\"none\"><img src=\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sorfeny_3-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"image 3\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"gslider-navigation-default-icon-wrapper inside center\"><div class=\"swiper-button-prev\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\"></div><div class=\"swiper-button-next\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Next slide\"></div></div></div><div class=\"swiper-pagination swiper-pagination-image-slider swiper-pagination-gslider-image-slider-f25445c2\" aria-label=\"Carousel pagination\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:gslider-blocks/image-slider -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ezeken a képeken egy led léptető látható ami öntartással működik és itt tanultuk meg használni az időzitöket.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":null}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":589,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_20260122_085438-1-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-589\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":587,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_20260122_085637-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-587\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Egy öntartásos közlekedési lámpát csináltam itt meg mivel tanár urat félre értettem mert a többiek egy sima gyalogos átkelő lámpáját kellet megvalósítani, a legnagyobb kihívás az volt hogy a sárga 2x szerepel benne így  a program mindig összeakadt de sikerült megoldanom és ki is díszítettem a HMI-n.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":null}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":592,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_20260122_090530-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-592\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":591,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_20260122_090546-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-591\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ezeken a képeken egy idözitett motor vezérlés látható, 5 másodpercig van  bekapcsolva a csillag kapcsolás majd utána delta kapcsolásra vált amit a ledek mutatnak.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":null}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":595,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_20260122_090816-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-595\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":596,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_20260122_090821-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-596\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":594,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://192.168.188.6/timara/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_20260122_092358-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-594\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A képeken egy olyan kapcsolás látható ami automatán és kézi módban is lehet vezérelni. Először ki kell választani milyen vezérlésben szeretnénk használni addig az öntartás le van tiltva, Ha kiválasztottuk a kézit akkor a Delta gombra kattintva lehet a csillagról delta kapcsolásra átváltani.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','PLC Programozás','','inherit','closed','closed','','535-revision-v1','','','2026-04-07 12:28:00','2026-04-07 10:28:00','',535,'http://192.168.188.6/timara/?p=1239',0,'revision','',0);
